WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.180
Open the platform —

2
00:00:01.570 --> 00:00:03.400
the steps are on your table card.

3
00:00:03.860 --> 00:00:07.445
Then hit Copy: the prompt below is already loaded

4
00:00:07.445 --> 00:00:08.650
with your five notes.

5
00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:11.010
Paste it in and read what comes back.

6
00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:12.900
Then push back on it —

7
00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:16.575
make it shorter, make it fit your room, swap

8
00:00:16.575 --> 00:00:17.830
what doesn't sound like you.

9
00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:18.770
You're the teacher.

10
00:00:18.770 --> 00:00:19.850
It's the assistant.
